{
  "rule_version": "commerce-routing-rule/1",
  "frozen": "2026-08-13",
  "rule_text": "commerce-routing-rule/1. For a job of class 'availability', route to the product-data corpus (demo/commerce/corpus/product-data). For a job of class 'compatibility', route to the product-data corpus (demo/commerce/corpus/product-data). For a job of class 'recommendation', route to the mixed corpus (demo/commerce/corpus). Derivation, deterministic and complete: for each class, the route is the supply condition with the strictly highest mean weighted objective (1.0 x measured coverage fraction + 0.5 x measured freshness fraction, the weights sealed in every fitting manifest) over that class's pre-registered fitting questions (demo/jobs/commerce-routing/split.json), computed from the committed fitting runs' evaluation records only. A tie on the mean objective leaves the class unrouted, published as such; none occurred. Frozen 13 August 2026, after the 24 fitting runs and before any holdout run. No holdout record contributed to this rule.",
  "rule_text_digest": "sha256:94214704a6b0642c324a9c81eac191fca15d52422e5db415d5e729da2b2f2d67",
